feat(scripts): add probe CLI to test texts against the llama endpoint

`npm run probe -- "text"` (or --file / stdin) runs the plugin's real
pipeline (topTokens -> cutoff -> completeWord -> mergeCandidates)
outside Obsidian and prints the raw top tokens plus the exact strip
candidates; --continue also shows the greedy continuation. Options:
--endpoint (default LLAMA_ENDPOINT or http://127.0.0.1:8081), --n,
--cutoff. Runs via Node's native TS transform mode, no extra deps.
scripts/ excluded from eslint like the other dev tooling.

